[
    {
        "id": "yonder-console",
        "type": "tab",
        "label": "Yonder console",
        "disabled": false,
        "info": "The shipped console.\n\nWIRING ONLY (CLAUDE.md rule 2). Every node here is either a Dashboard\nwidget, a core node moving a value from one place to another, or one of\nthe `yonder-*` adapters from packages/node-red-contrib-yonder-*. There is\nno `function` node and there cannot be one: `settings.js` excludes the\ntype, and `src/flows.test.ts` asserts against this file.\n\nAnything that needed a decision was written in yonder-core instead \u2014\nthe number formatting on the status page, the folding of a Wi-Fi scan, the\nmerge that turns a form into a configuration, and the command-state\nlanguage that decides what pending, confirmed and rejected look like.",
        "env": []
    },
